WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
[No sound] The Boost hero: a real-time 3D can lands in front of "Natural Power" with a burst of fizz.

00:02.600 --> 00:05.150
Scrolling down, the can lifts off the hero while the headline drifts up and fades.

00:05.150 --> 00:07.430
"Super Natural Power": the can stands upright in a neon ring as lightning crackles around it.

00:07.430 --> 00:12.800
"Natural Taste and Power": the can leans behind three frosted glass ingredient circles, then travels on.

00:12.800 --> 00:14.390
The flavour lineup: the can lands on a glowing pedestal between the other three flavours.

00:14.390 --> 00:16.320
Next flavour: Low Sugar slides into the centre and the page turns icy cyan.

00:16.320 --> 00:19.880
Next again: Burn takes the pedestal and the whole page glows red.
